    "operation": "Match the prior normalization shader and expanded draw quad at each destination pixel: linear/clamp-sample the source at UV ((pixelCenter-pad)/inner), divide by the 64-grid RGB mean floored at 0.05, clamp [0.35,1.85], multiply by 0.5, and quantize to RGBA8.",
